<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Git - 标签 - 不北咪</title><link>https://roukaixin.github.io/tags/git/</link><description>不北咪</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha.1</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>a3427173515@163.com (不北咪)</managingEditor><webMaster>a3427173515@163.com (不北咪)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:55:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://roukaixin.github.io/tags/git/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>git filter-repo 命令使用</title><link>https://roukaixin.github.io/posts/git/filter-repo/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 10:07:00 +0800</pubDate><author>a3427173515@163.com (不北咪)</author><guid>https://roukaixin.github.io/posts/git/filter-repo/</guid><category domain="https://roukaixin.github.io/categories/git/">Git</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="前提"&gt;&lt;span&gt;前提&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%89%8d%e6%8f%90" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在日常使用 git 中，我们可能会把文件中的密钥上传到远程仓库中，所以就需要把远程仓库中的密钥给覆盖掉。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>git 合并分支</title><link>https://roukaixin.github.io/posts/git/merge/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 21:07:00 +0800</pubDate><author>a3427173515@163.com (不北咪)</author><guid>https://roukaixin.github.io/posts/git/merge/</guid><category domain="https://roukaixin.github.io/categories/git/">Git</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="合并远程分支"&gt;&lt;span&gt;合并远程分支&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%90%88%e5%b9%b6%e8%bf%9c%e7%a8%8b%e5%88%86%e6%94%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;# 更新远程分支&#10;git pull&#10;&#10;# 如果有冲突，使用暂存&#10;git stash push&#10;&#10;# 在使用 git pull 更新代码&#10;&#10;# 更新之后取消暂存&#10;git stash pop&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title>git 子模块使用</title><link>https://roukaixin.github.io/posts/git/submodule/</link><pubDate>Sat, 27 Dec 2025 15:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>a3427173515@163.com (不北咪)</author><guid>https://roukaixin.github.io/posts/git/submodule/</guid><category domain="https://roukaixin.github.io/categories/git/">Git</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="删除子模块"&gt;&lt;span&gt;删除子模块&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%88%a0%e9%99%a4%e5%ad%90%e6%a8%a1%e5%9d%97" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;# 从配置中删除子模块信息。.git/config&#10;git submodule deinit -f path/to/submodule&#10;&#10;# 删除 git 子模块文件&#10;rm -rf .git/modules/path/to/submodule&#10;&#10;# 取消跟踪子模块文件&#10;git rm -f path/to/submodule&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>